<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Friday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p> Bank of America     10.25 /10.15   10.625/10.525   11.30 /11.20</p>
<p> BPI		     10.50 /10.35   10.80 /10.65    11.40 /11.20</p>
<p> Citibank		10.375/10.20   10.875/10.60    11.50</p>
<p>/11.125</p>
<p> HongKongBank	  10.375/10.275  10.65 /10.55    11.20 /11.10</p>
<p> Multinational	 10.45 /10.325  10.80 /10.60    11.25 /11.05</p>
<p> Solidbank	     10.40 /10.30   10.75 /10.65    11.15 /11.05</p>
<p> Standard		10.50 /10.25   10.90 /10.65    11.50 /11.25</p>
